  both FLOW (the truth)        verdict admit-uncertified    C9 refusals: 0
  shell flipped to EFFORT      verdict refuse               C9 refusals: 1
  gas flipped to EFFORT        verdict refuse               C9 refusals: 1
  BOTH flipped to EFFORT       verdict admit-uncertified    C9 refusals: 0

  leg 1  same half both sides, correct   -> no C9 refusal : True
  leg 2  ONE side wrong                  -> C9 REFUSES    : True
  leg 3  BOTH sides wrong                -> no C9 refusal : True

  Leg 3 is the finding and it is a NEGATIVE one: a matching pair of
  wrong halves passes silently, on real solvers, exactly as W66 said
  it does on a fixture built to fail.

